//     an explicit stable id carrying the OLD string:  {id:"alte Schreibweise",
//     de:"neue Schreibweise", ...}  — ids, when present, take precedence.
//  4. Duplicate `de` values within one category are forbidden (progress keys
//     would collide); the validator enforces this.
